DOCK-007|P0|Removing a Dock reference must never uninstall or delete its target.|DOCK-006; persistent item model in M2.|Given a pinned target, when its Dock entry is removed, then only the Dock reference disappears and the target remains available; after restart the removal remains.|M1 safety review; Windows persistence/file-system integration in M7; REF-05 Mac sample NOT TESTED.
