DOCK-043|P2|Force Quit is destructive and belongs behind explicit user intent.|DOCK-015/016; process identity; explicit confirmation and unsaved-data warning.|Given an unresponsive eligible app, when Force Quit is selected, then the action clearly identifies its target and warns about data loss before termination; cancellation leaves the process untouched.|M1 safety review; Windows process-control integration in M6; REF-04 Mac sample NOT TESTED.
